## CRITICAL RULES (NEVER VIOLATE)
- Database: NEON PostgreSQL ONLY (process.env.DATABASE_URL)
- Storage: Cloudflare R2 ONLY (never local files)
- ORM: Drizzle ONLY (never raw SQL)
- Validation: Zod on ALL inputs
- TypeScript: strict mode, NO `any` type
- Arabic text: Baghdad dialect, ZERO emoji
- Content Engine: use recommended_model from generation_settings

## STACK
- Frontend: React + Vite (client/)
- Backend: Express + Drizzle (server/)
- DB: NEON PostgreSQL
- Storage: Cloudflare R2
- Deploy: Vercel

## KEY PATHS
- Schema: server/db/schema.ts
